  "environment": "sandbox",
  "method": "EC2 authorization is read with --dry-run against the real API, never from iam:SimulatePrincipalPolicy. DryRunOperation means the request would have succeeded; UnauthorizedOperation means it would not; a *LimitExceeded code means authorization passed and there is no room; anything else means the request never reached authorization. The simulator's OrganizationsDecisionDetail reported ten of these actions as denied in both regions when seven are authorized in us-east-1, which is why the method is recorded here rather than assumed.",
